OL,3,GNEWSAMurder investigation closed after
OL,4,Aman dies on beach
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police force has closed its murder
OL,7,Finvestigation after a man died on a
OL,8,Fbeach in Gwynedd.
OL,10,FA 24-year-old man arrested in
OL,11,Fconnection with the death in Barmouth
OL,12,Fhas been released with no further
OL,13,Faction, North Wales Police said.
OL,15,FThe 34-year-old man died following an
OL,16,Fincident in the water at the beach on
OL,17,F25 May.
OL,19,FA report into his death is being
OL,20,Fcompiled and will be submitted to the
OL,21,Fcoroner, and his family has been
OL,22,Finformed.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
